  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fsvrve%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e556f05801baf51f64eb079db94542fd6cd7acd8.png\" alt=\"PMC\"></a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/svrve/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/186466038ea8fdc8a1e106328e1469b76d340fd7.png\" alt=\"CurseForge\"> </a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSvrve\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp; <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/d639cdb1abcfbf97e4e313512a39293a0b55f3c8.png\" alt=\"Modrinth\"> &nbsp;</a><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/045c08f0228147ad2f1ce76cbc4be4d1e782e798.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fsvrve\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ccd82ceb15cb98213e7e9ef49d36ecd3bfd15871.png\" alt=\"早期访问\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">你可以在KO-FI上订阅月度会员以获取更快的更新</p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>关于</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">我建模并贴图了所有类型的熔炉，包括开启和关闭状态，并将它们全部打包在一起！你可以在下方看到关闭状态的版本。更多信息请查看画廊，或者直接安装并亲自体验！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">.</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/cc3dd5b653c925134aa51ee5030c9c59a2ecb914.png\" alt=\"熔炉\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/dfb6c8280484535c15aabdbe402d1f022c64ece9.png\" alt=\"高炉\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/495d6b6a0ab88c7e690bc61e9d7a926ee66818d0.png\" alt=\"烟熏炉\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>常见问题</strong></h1><blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>如何安装资源包？</strong>&nbsp;YouTube上有许多教程，它们能比我解释得更清楚。简单来说，从Modrinth或CurseForge等可信网站下载文件，然后在Minecraft中点击“打开资源包文件夹”，将下载的文件拖入弹出的文件夹即可。</p>\n</blockquote><blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>我可以在自己的资源包中使用其中的部分资源吗？</strong>&nbsp;安装后，请打开你下载的（.zip）文件。你会在其中找到许可协议，请仔细阅读。</p>\n</blockquote><blockquote>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>是否需要安装任何模组？</strong>&nbsp;不需要，完全原版兼容。</p>\n</blockquote>",
